      "slug": "gram:doushite",
      "variants": [],
      "steps_unavailable": "Clause-initial interrogative adverb: the record's formation is どうして + sentence. It precedes the clause and changes nothing in it; the op enum has no prepend operation, so any step list would either produce the bare clause or attach どうして as a suffix, which is wrong.",
